{"id":402602042,"chapter_id":50070,"scene_id":57009,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"从没见过这么麻烦的战斗，我们在这边受到太大限制，局长也被困在那种地方。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_03"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"选项","options":["仔细思考对策"],"jump":[3],"style":6,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"这似乎是由000操控的领域，在她这个领域之内，你们无论杀死多少怪物，也都只是她再挥一挥手的事。","style":3,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"想在这里打败000，几乎是不可能的事，除非——","style":3,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……我记得……艾米潘以前干过大事。","style":2,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"我？真的假的？","voice":["vo_event_402602042_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"想起来了，海拉说你一箭破坏了辛迪加整个供电系统，搞出很大的混乱。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"这个城市好像也是以电力为主……你可以的。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"开玩笑的吧那可是一个人一生一次的光辉时刻，哪有那么容易复刻的？？","voice":["vo_event_402602042_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"雷比尼斯","content":"你也可以一辈子夹着这把滑稽可爱的嗓音，莓丝一定狠狠嘲笑你。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"机器人戳了一下艾米潘，她发出了奇怪的嗷的一声。","style":3,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"呜呜……不想……我这么强大帅气的禁闭者居然沦为搞笑角色，不可以……","voice":["vo_event_402602042_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"这次真是你们逼我的了！","voice":["vo_event_402602042_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"艾米潘用尽全身的力气对着天空射出一箭，强大的电流击穿了空气，仿佛暴雷降临大地。","style":3,"background":2269,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"下一个瞬间，这个城区突然陷入了黑暗，骤然而起的惊呼声和大片的议论声也刺破屏障传了进来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"代码嘎","content":"嘎？！（啥？！）","voice":["vo_event_402602042_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"鸭子一下子清醒了过来。下车到处查看。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"远远看着它打开手机，四处张望，困惑地挠头——看来完全不知道自己为什么会开到这种地方。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"和你设想得一致。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"……那只鸭子恢复了意识，刺杀领域解除了！","voice":["vo_event_402602042_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"选项","options":["我们赢了"],"jump":[23],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那只ya……神已经恢复清醒，你的刺杀领域被破了。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"000","content":"……","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"她却没有回答，抬头看着天边，看着远方暗灭着灯又逐渐亮起的城市，像在聆听什么。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"不知道她看见了什么，000脸上少有的没了笑意。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"选项","options":["你在看什么？"],"jump":[28],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"000","content":"没什么，我只是觉得有点可惜。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"她回过头，面对你时又露出笑容。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"000","content":"这回合不算，有人违反游戏规则，过度使用狂厄被发现了。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"000","content":"刚刚的大停电已经引起神的注意，很快就会调查发现艾米潘的狂厄箭矢。接下来……呵呵，后果应该会很刺激。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"呜……会、会怎样？","voice":["vo_event_402602042_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"speaker":"选项","options":["别被吓住了"],"jump":[34],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"她只是输了就耍赖而已。真有这种规则，一开始不说，自己用狂厄力量时不说？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"speaker":"000","content":"玩得高兴，忘了嘛。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"000","content":"我做坏事都很小心的，知道怎么藏小尾巴。就算杀了神，它们也查不出破绽，让大家都死得合规死得其所，不被怀疑就好啦。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"000","content":"下次教你点小技巧？","voice":["vo_event_402602042_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"speaker":"选项","options":["少来这套"],"jump":[39],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"目标已经离开，你的计划失败了，怎么泼冷水都无所谓。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"现在我也不是一个人，禁闭者们都来了，她们有足够的实力阻止你，这之后不会再顺你意。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"000","content":"没有之后了，你们已经搞砸了，要想逃避惩罚就得要往回跑，一切重来。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"speaker":"000","content":"局长，你知道游戏的“重来”是什么意思吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602042_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"content":"远处，“代码嘎”离开的方向突然传来一声巨响。随即，一些光斑缓缓汇聚到000手心。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"speaker":"000","content":"看好了，游戏的经典设计，在你们挑战失败、或者出了差错时，送你回到过去的保存点，再给大家一次机会。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"speaker":"000","content":"这就是它最温柔的地方，只要你还想挑战还想争取，那无论失败多少次，都可以重来。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"content":"她抬起手，随即身体被快速瓦解，化做风暴席卷你们所有人，一切都被这世间的风暴瓦解，连你也从手机里被释放出来。","style":3,"background":2247,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长！！","voice":["vo_event_402602042_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2247,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"content":"你抓住赫卡蒂的手，随即又被冲散。在被吞噬的最后瞬间，你隐隐听到她的声音。","style":3,"background":2247,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"speaker":"000","content":"做好准备，我们老地方见。","voice":["vo_event_402602042_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26204","style":1,"background":2247,"log_type":1}]}